---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="What we do — Jersey Round Table"
  description="Santa visits across all 12 parishes, the annual Charity Ball, the restoration of Gigoulande Mill, and Tuesday-night fellowship. Here's what JRT actually does."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-max) px-6 pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-rt-sea">What we do</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl">Big nights, big builds, and a sleigh that visits every parish.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg max-w-2xl">
      Three flagship traditions, plus the smaller stuff that quietly adds up across a year.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-max) px-6 py-10">
    <article class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-rt-sea">Tradition</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2">The Santa float</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          For decades, Santa has ridden a red sleigh through every one of Jersey's twelve
          parishes in the run-up to Christmas. The float doubles as a collection &mdash; proceeds
          go to the <strong>Jersey Charities Appeal</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          It's the part of Jersey Round Table most islanders know us for. For a lot of Jersey
          kids, it's also the first they hear of us.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <Button href="/events" variant="secondary">See this year's parish dates</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="md:col-span-2 rounded-(--radius-card) bg-rt-yellow/30 p-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-rt-navy">At a glance</p>
        <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <div>
            <dt class="text-rt-mute">Parishes visited</dt>
            <dd class="text-rt-navy font-semibold">All 12</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-rt-mute">Beneficiary</dt>
            <dd class="text-rt-navy font-semibold">Jersey Charities Appeal</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-rt-mute">When</dt>
            <dd class="text-rt-navy font-semibold">December, every year</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-rt-navy text-rt-paper py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-max) px-6 grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-rt-yellow">Fundraiser</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-rt-paper">The annual Charity Ball</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-rt-paper/85">
          The chapter's signature fundraiser. Held in late November at the
          <strong class="text-rt-paper">Royal Jersey Showground</strong>: 400 to 500 guests,
          black tie, a three-course dinner, a themed performance by members, a live band, and
          a raffle that has been known to get out of hand.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-rt-paper/85">
          Headline sponsor: <strong class="text-rt-paper">warm.je</strong>. Catering by
          <strong class="text-rt-paper">Harpers</strong>. Recent line-ups have featured
          <strong class="text-rt-paper">Inside Job</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex gap-3 flex-wrap">
          <Button href="/grants" variant="primary">Charities we've supported</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="md:col-span-2 rounded-(--radius-card) bg-rt-paper/10 p-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-rt-yellow">2024 beneficiaries</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-rt-paper/90 list-none p-0">
          <li>Happy Heroes Jersey</li>
          <li>Tiny Seeds</li>
          <li>Freeda Jersey</li>
          <li>Jersey RFC Women</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-max) px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <article class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-rt-sea">Case study</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2">Restoring Gigoulande Mill</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          La Gigoulande Mill in St Peter's Valley is a Crown mill first registered in 1247 &mdash;
          one of only four watermills in the British Isles known to have used two overshot
          wheels.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          In 2019 we approached the then HM Receiver General to volunteer on the conservation
          project. Over the next three years we felled scrub, exposed and repaired the
          deteriorated dam wall with specialist masons, cleared the pond bed, installed a sluice
          gate, and built a spillway. The millpond was opened by then Lieutenant-Governor
          <strong>Air Chief Marshal Sir Stephen Dalton</strong> in December 2020. The connecting
          footpath was opened by his successor, <strong>Vice-Admiral Jerry Kyd</strong>, in
          December 2022.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          The mill is open to the public. The walk is worth the trip.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="md:col-span-2 rounded-(--radius-card) bg-rt-sea/10 p-6">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-rt-sea">Project facts</p>
        <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <div>
            <dt class="text-rt-mute">First registered</dt>
            <dd class="text-rt-navy font-semibold">1247</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-rt-mute">Years on site</dt>
            <dd class="text-rt-navy font-semibold">2019&ndash;2022</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-rt-mute">Opened by</dt>
            <dd class="text-rt-navy font-semibold">Two Lieutenant-Governors</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="text-rt-mute">Partners</dt>
            <dd class="text-rt-navy font-semibold">National Trust for Jersey, Jersey Trees for Life, Probation Service</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-rt-paper border-t border-black/5">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-(--container-max) px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
      <h2>And the smaller stuff</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl">
        Not every year produces a Lieutenant-Governor ribbon-cut. Most years it's the steady
        rhythm of these.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <Card>
          <h3>Casino nights</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-rt-mute">Hosted events at venues across the island.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3>Bag packs</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-rt-mute">Supermarket fundraising weekends.</p>
        </Card>
        <Card>
          <h3>Environment days</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-rt-mute">Annual clearing of invasive species with the National Trust for Jersey.</p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
